","The expression of oncogenes plays a crucial role in tumor growth by promoting uncontrolled cell proliferation and survival. They are the ""hyperogenes"" of the cell, which can become oncogenes when mutated or overexpressed. Here are some key steps of how they contribute to tumor growth:

