   - **Enhancing cell survival pathways:** Oncogenes can activate survival pathways, such as the PIKK/AKT pathway, which promotes cell survival and survival.

   c. Enhanced Cell Migration and Metastesis:** Some oncogenes can promote the migration and metastasis of cancer cells, allowing them to spread to other parts of the body.

