7. Continuous polymerization: Continuous polymerization processes can offer higher efficiency and higher yield compared to batch processes.

8. Continuous recycling of byproducts: Some byproducts can be recycled and used as raw materials for other processes, which can help reduce the overall waste and improve the overall efficiency of the process.

