","A space group is a mathematical description of the symmetry operations that can be applied to a crystal structure, leaving the crystal's appearance unchanged. It is the most fundamental way to describe the symmetry of a crystal structure. This is essential because the symmetry of a crystal structure affects its physical properties, such as mechanical strength, optical properties, and electronic properties.

