1. For 9 heads:
   \[
   \binom{12}{9} (0.5)^{12} = \binom{12}{3} (0.5)^{12} = \frac{12 \times 11 \times 10}{3 \times 2 \times 1} (0.5)^{12} = 120 (0.5)^{12}
   \]
