   \[
   \binom{12}{10} (0.5)^{12} = \binom{12}{2} (0.5)^{12} = \frac{12 \times 11}{2 \times 1} (0.5)^{12} = 66 (0.5)^{12}
   \]
3. For 11 heads:
   \[
   \binom{12}{11} (0.5)^{12} = \binom{12}{1} (0.5)^{12} = 12 (0.5)^{12}
   \]
