\[ a = \frac{v^2}{r} \implies r = \frac{v^2}{a} = \frac{800^2}{9} = \frac{640000}{9} \, \text{m} \]  

Substituting \( r \) back into \( m \):  
\[ m = \frac{9}{178} \cdot \frac{640000}{9} = \frac{640000}{178} \approx 2861 \, \text{kg} \]  

