   The molar mass of the mixture is:  
   \[ \text{Molar mass of mixture} = x \times 120 + (1 - x) \times 46 = 573.2 \]  
   (Molar mass of NO₂ = 2 × 28 (N) + 16 (O) = 46 g/mol)  

4. **Solve for \( x \)**:  
