   \[ 25.67 = 120x + 46(1 - x) \]  
   \[ 25.67 = 120x + 46 - 46x \]  
   \[ 74x = 10.31 \]  
   \[ x = 0.139 \]  

5. **Fraction of NO₂**:  
   Fraction of NO₂ = \( 1 - x = 1 - 0.139 = 0.861 \)  

6. **Percentage of NO₂**:  
   Percentage of NO₂ = \( 0.861 \times 100 = 86.1\% \)  

