- \( I \) is the current in the coil (1 A)
- \( N \) is the number of turns (100)
- \( r \) is the radius of the coil (0.2 m)
- \( \mu_0 \) is the permeability of free space, which is \( 4\pi \times 10^{-7} \, \text{T·m/A} \).

