   - (c) **Relative humidity**: The ratio of the actual water vapor pressure to the saturation vapor pressure at the dry-bulb temperature.  
   - (d) **Dew-point temperature**: The temperature at which air becomes saturated when cooled at constant pressure.  
   - (e) **Specific volume**: The volume occupied by a unit mass of dry air.  

